502
00:31:42,600 --> 00:31:46,880
The biggest mistake people make is talking about personal problems.

503
00:31:46,880 --> 00:31:53,060
Saying things like, my rent is higher or I need more money doesn't help.

504
00:31:53,060 --> 00:31:57,880
Managers make salary decisions based on performance, not personal situations.

505
00:31:57,880 --> 00:32:01,680
So instead, you should talk about what you've contributed.

506
00:32:01,680 --> 00:32:09,240
For example, I've taken on additional responsibilities, or I've successfully completed several projects.

507
00:32:09,240 --> 00:32:11,200
